flowchart TD
  A[POST /webhook] --> B{Raw body + x-alchemy-signature}
  B --> C{SKIP_SIGNATURE_VALIDATION?}
  C -->|yes dev only| F[Resolve dispatch]
  C -->|no| D{Valid signature?}
  D -->|no| E[401 Invalid signature]
  D -->|yes| F
  F --> G[onEvent: handlers]
  G --> H[Handle events / txs / internal_calls]
  H --> I[rules-engine runRules]
  I --> J{Alert?}
  J -->|yes| K[buildTelegramMessage + sendTelegram]
  J -->|no| L[Log only]
  K --> M[200 OK]
  L --> M
